<BaseLayout locale="en" title="User guide · GenshinPiano"><section class="page-hero shell"><span class="eyebrow">QUICK START</span><h1>From download to your first performance</h1><p>Install, import, edit, and play in four steps.</p></section><section class="section shell"><div class="steps">{steps.map(([n,title,copy])=><article><span>{n}</span><div><h2>{title}</h2><p>{copy}</p></div></article>)}</div><div class="guide-grid"><article class="card prose"><h2>Safe playback</h2><p>Playback waits for <code>YuanShen.exe</code> or <code>GenshinImpact.exe</code> to be focused. It pauses whenever the game loses focus.</p><p>If the game runs as administrator, manually start GenshinPiano as administrator too. The app never elevates itself.</p><p>Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> in game to pause and release held keys.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Keyboard shortcuts</h2><dl class="shortcuts">{shortcuts.map(([key,label])=><><dt><kbd>{key}</kbd></dt><dd>{label}</dd></>)}</dl></article></div><div class="center-action"><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/tozyx/GenshinPiano/blob/main/docs/USER_GUIDE.md#english">Read the full user guide →</a></div></section></BaseLayout>